research-wiki/frontier-cells\ASTIS-SW-PBPS-actual-finite-count-path.json:45:    "truth_boundary": "Exactly six source analytic hypotheses. Literal actual stopped recurrence and canonical iid Exp(1) product; all finite n and NNReal T including zero. One jointly measurable actual phase Z with pointwise covered-arc and explicit uncovered fallback semantics; fixed-T coordinate-product path carrier. Total count is Nat.find of the half-open interval index, with zero fallback. Total history interpolation is an increasing-index Fin.foldl; its measurability and path identification are conclusions. Density is the ordered-prefix q times terminal survival, with unnormalized joint history/path pushforward, all ENNReal tests and exact count-event mass. Fixed-T endpoint nullity and simultaneous all-count/cardinality interpretation are AE, not a common no-jump event over all T. Raw C events are disjoint and their union has full measure. No law, positivity, independence, nonexplosion, measurable witness or integrability provider is a public premise. Hazard stitching, pre-jump left limits, infinite full A7 assembly/absolute convergence, Skorokhod compatibility, restart/Markovness, invariance, hypocoercivity, implementation errors, expected costs, main results, actual-input composition and full papers remain OPEN.",
